| Decision | Accountable owner | Required review |
|---|---|---|
| Global health-feature standard | Chief Product and Medical/Clinical Officer | Regulatory, quality, privacy, safety, and board risk review |
| Intended-use statement | Clinical and Regulatory Leads | Local regulatory counsel and quality approval |
